# This is a placeholder pointer file, not the real list of environment variables.
#
# The actual, complete list of environment variables this project uses --
# with comments on what each one is for and when you need it -- lives at:
#
#     langgraph_agent/.env.example
#
# Copy THAT file to langgraph_agent/.env and fill in real values:
#
#     cd langgraph_agent
#     cp .env.example .env
#
# (This root-level file used to be empty/near-empty, which made it look like
# the real config list -- it wasn't. See README.md section 4 for the full
# setup walkthrough.)
